The canonical history operations in shaders/history.metal adapt the circular
history utilities in MuJoCo 3.10.0 src/engine/engine_util_misc.c and the sensor
read/advance ordering in engine_sensor.c and engine_forward.c. The tactile
kernels follow the taxel layout, distance and velocity semantics in
engine_sensor.c. These upstream files carry the DeepMind copyright and Apache
License, Version 2.0, identified above.

Additional native algorithms and stage semantics adapt these MuJoCo 3.10.0
sources under src/engine (Apache License, Version 2.0):

- Constraint assembly, solving, collision dispatch, passive forces, forward
  and inverse stages, ray queries, constant recomputation, and vector utilities:
  engine_core_constraint.c, engine_solver.c, engine_collision_driver.c,
  engine_passive.c, engine_forward.c, engine_inverse.c, engine_ray.c,
  engine_setconst.c, engine_support.c, and engine_util_blas.c.
  Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited.
- Finite-difference derivative semantics: engine_derivative.c.
  Copyright 2022 DeepMind Technologies Limited.
- Island construction: engine_island.c.
  Copyright 2023 DeepMind Technologies Limited.
- Convex and deformable GJK/EPA collision semantics: engine_collision_gjk.c.
  Copyright 2024 DeepMind Technologies Limited.
- Flex/core utilities and sleep scheduling: engine_core_util.c and
  engine_sleep.c. Copyright 2025 DeepMind Technologies Limited.

The bundled native PID, cable elasticity, touch-grid, and analytic SDF adapters
follow the corresponding upstream plugin algorithms and configuration semantics:

- plugin/actuator/pid.cc and plugin/sensor/touch_grid.cc:
